the service request procedure is initiated in response to paging or notification from the network;

the UE is a UE configured for high priority access in selected PLMN;

the service request procedure is initiated to establish an emergency PDU session;

the UE has an emergency PDU session established;

the service request procedure is initiated for emergency services fallback;

the UE is registered in a new PLMN; or

